Scope and third-party material

This license covers the original code, documentation, vector designs and
illustration assets created for TDG — Ascensão, only to the extent that their
maintainer may grant rights in those works. The project was developed with AI
assistance; original illustration assets were generated with ImageGen.

Tales of Demons and Gods, its characters, names and fictional universe, and
Balatro and its underlying game assets are third-party material. Rights in
that material are excluded from this license and remain with their respective
rights holders. This license does not grant ownership of, or permission to
redistribute, those underlying third-party works. TDG — Ascensão is an
unofficial fan mod and does not claim endorsement by their creators.

Steamodded, Lovely and Talisman are separate projects distributed under their
own licenses. They are dependencies and are not bundled in this package.
